<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Week 0 - Orientation & Introduction</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f4f6f9;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --text: #1f2937;
      --muted: #5f6b7a;
      --accent: #ff7a1a;
      --accent-dark: #d75f00;
      --line: #e5e7eb;
      --shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.12);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef4fb 0%, #f9f5ee 100%);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 36px 28px 48px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 16px 6px 24px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent-dark);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: #1a2333;
    }

    .intro {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 860px;
    }

    .section {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2vw, 2.1rem);
      color: #1a2333;
    }

    .content-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .panel {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 22px 20px;
    }

    .panel ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      line-height: 2;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .highlight-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff8ef 0%, #fff2e7 100%);
      border: 1px solid #ffd7b5;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 20px 18px;
    }

    .highlight-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--accent-dark);
    }

    .highlight-box p {
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .photo-card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }

    .photo-card img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 260px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .photo-card figcaption {
      padding: 14px 14px 16px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: #fff;
    }

    .reflection {
      margin-top: 34px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7fafc 0%, #eef8ff 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 22px 20px;
    }

    .reflection p {
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 1.03rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .content-grid,
      .gallery {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .container {
        margin: 20px 12px;
        padding: 24px 16px 32px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Week 0</p>
      <h1>Orientation &amp; Introduction</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        This week helped us settle into the Protosem program, understand the learning journey,
        and start building our confidence as a team. It also served as a warm introduction to the
        mentors, batchmates, and expectations for the weeks ahead.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="panel">
          <ul>
            <li>Introduced to the Protosem structure, goals, and learning culture.</li>
            <li>Learned about teamwork, responsibility, and the importance of collaboration.</li>
            <li>Understood the need to stay consistent and open to learning throughout the semester.</li>
            <li>Started building a sense of community with the batch and faculty mentors.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="highlight-box">
          <h3>Reflection</h3>
          <p>
            Week 0 was more than an orientation. It gave everyone a chance to introduce themselves,
            understand their goals, and begin forming a strong collaborative mindset for the work ahead.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Week 0 Highlights</h2>
      <div class="gallery">
        <figure class="photo-card">
          <img src="../week 0 pic 1.JPG" alt="Week 0 introduction photo 1" />
          <figcaption>Introducing ourselves and sharing our background and interests.</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="photo-card">
          <img src="../week 0  pic 2.JPG" alt="Week 0 introduction photo 2" />
          <figcaption>Team interaction and early discussions with classmates and mentors.</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="photo-card">
          <img src="../week 0 pic 3.JPG" alt="Week 0 introduction photo 3" />
          <figcaption>Building a sense of belonging and setting the tone for the semester.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reflection">
      <p>
        The week closed with self-introductions to the rest of the batch and the mentors. This gave everyone
        a chance to share their background, interests, and goals. For my part, I spoke about my interest in
        robotics, automation, and AI, and what I hoped to learn from the Protosem experience. It was a small
        but meaningful step in building the sense of team that would carry through the rest of the semester.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
